        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nikwo oritwaza ente zaawe n'entaama zaawe; omujigaijo gwayo guryamara ebiro mushanju na nyinagwo; aha kiro kya munaana oryaguntoijera. ",
          "type": "text",
